  "summary": "作者解释财与囚仇及廉贞囚星称谓，区分化忌或多煞少吉与化禄会吉。正格要求武曲命宫、廉贞所在宫为身宫且廉贞或武曲化忌；身宫不在廉贞处则为偏格。陷地贫贱不能径断，须合星曜、职业工作及行限。",
  "summary_en": "The author explains Cai Yu Qiu Chou and Lian Zhen as the Prison Star: Hua Ji or many malefics with little auspicious support differs from Hua Lu with benefics. The primary form requires Wu Qu in the Life Palace and the Body Palace at Lian Zhen, with either Lian Zhen or Wu Qu undergoing Hua Ji; otherwise the stated configuration is secondary. Poverty is not automatic: companions, occupation and fortune cycles matter.",
